WEBVTT

00:26:28.642 --> 00:26:30.082
(Both laugh)

00:26:30.106 --> 00:26:32.272
AB: Well, thanks for the support, Adam.

00:26:32.296 --> 00:26:33.978
(Distant laughter and conversation)

00:26:34.002 --> 00:26:35.717
AG: We had to see it for ourselves,

00:26:35.741 --> 00:26:38.004
so let's go to the Cleveland Clinic.

00:26:38.440 --> 00:26:41.086
AB: Hopefully,
you're in the right place. (Laughs)

00:26:41.110 --> 00:26:43.658
So this is the ready to communicate,
how to enhance --

00:26:43.682 --> 00:26:46.956
AG: In a big conference room,
a dozen practitioners sat in a circle.

00:26:46.980 --> 00:26:49.114
Mary Beth Modic:
Hello, I'm Mary Beth Modic.

00:26:49.138 --> 00:26:51.145
I'm a clinical nurse
specialist, inpatient.

00:26:51.169 --> 00:26:55.436
Aparna Prakash: I'm an internist
at the Solon Family Health Center.

00:26:55.460 --> 00:26:57.876
Participant 1: I'm a physical therapist.

00:26:57.900 --> 00:27:01.247
AG: As an icebreaker, they told each other
about their first car.